flowchart TD
    A([A track starts]) --> P[Next provider: LRCLIB, Musixmatch, NetEase, Genius]
    P --> S{Synced lyrics of this length?}
    S -- yes --> K[Karaoke]
    S -- no --> R[Its plain text is kept if it is the first one found]
    R --> M{Another provider left?}
    M -- yes --> P
    M -- no --> T{Lyrics in your tags?}
    T -- yes --> TAGS[Your tags' text]
    T -- no --> W{Plain text found on the web?}
    W -- yes --> WEB[The web's text]
    W -- no --> N["“No lyrics found”"]
